WEBVTT

NOTE
The D-District Prison structure and its Galbadia control tower.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
A grated gangway runs toward the prison structure.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.350
The massive central column meets the broken desert rock below.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.650
The red control tower, stenciled 'Galbadia Prison Control Tower', rises against the sky.
